        "en": "The pipeline below \"works\", but it contains **three mistakes** that make its security useless.\n\n```yaml\nname: pipeline\non: [push]\n\njobs:\n  image:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - run: docker build -t shop-api:${{ github.sha }} .\n      - run: |\n          docker run --rm -v /var/run/docker.sock:/var/run/docker.sock \\\n            aquasec/trivy:0.65.0 image --severity HIGH,CRITICAL \\\n            --exit-code 0 shop-api:${{ github.sha }}\n\n  deploy:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - run: echo \"Deploying to production\"\n```\n\n1. Find the three mistakes.\n2. Rewrite the fixed pipeline.\n"
